			"Message": "fix(Sky): Add diagnostic logging to webview postMessage bridge\n\nInstrument the `sky://webview/postMessage` handler in `Bridge.ts` to log key lifecycle events to the Mountain diagnostic channel. Insert `MountainIPCInvoke` calls to capture: entry receipt, registry lookup state, successful dispatch attempt, and execution errors.\n\nThese logs include the ViewId, message type availability, and registry status to facilitate debugging of IPC failures between the Astro UI and the VS Code workbench webviews. Error messages are truncated to 120 characters to fit diagnostic buffers.\n\nThis enhancement provides visibility into the event bridge's internal flow without altering the core dispatch logic or payload structure.",
